flowchart TD
    A([Scheduled trigger]) --> B[Load config and credentials]
    B --> C[Download POS and ERP data]
    C --> D{Files, schema, date, totals valid?}
    D -- No --> X[Quarantine batch and notify]
    D -- Yes --> E[Normalize data and create queue items]
    E --> F{Next queue item?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Calculate expected balance and variance]
    G --> H{Within approved auto-adjust rules?}
    H -- No --> I[Create human exception with reason and evidence]
    H -- Yes --> J[Update ERP and reread value]
    J --> K{Verified after-value?}
    K -- No --> R{Retries remaining?}
    R -- Yes --> J
    R -- No --> S[System exception and support alert]
    K -- Yes --> L{At/below reorder point and supply insufficient?}
    L -- Yes --> M[Create draft replenishment request]
    L -- No --> N[Mark transaction successful]
    M --> N
    I --> F
    S --> F
    N --> F
    F -- No --> O[Balance counts and control totals]
    O --> P{Balanced?}
    P -- No --> Q[Mark batch incomplete and escalate]
    P -- Yes --> T[Publish KPI dataset and summary]
    X --> U([End])
    Q --> U
    T --> U
